    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d517">

                <pb facs="0643" n="633" xml:id="pg633"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/12–748: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Taipei</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Krentz</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Taipei</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-07T16:00:00+08:00">December 7, 1948—4
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 7—5:11 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>91. Estimate about 40,000 refugees arrived here to date all classes carrying
                    large amounts US [currency?] and gold bars. Key money rates soaring Taipei;
                    3-room Jap house US 10,000.</p>
                <p>Far as known no very big names except Chen Kuo-fu<anchor n="2" xml:id="d517-f1"/>
                    but mostly families [with] connections Taiwan officials, plus merchants,
                    professional and secondary mainland officials families. Some advance CAF<anchor
                        n="3" xml:id="d517-f2"/> arrivals.</p>
                <p>Sent Nanking 179, repeated Department 91.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Krentz</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d517-f1" n="2" xml:id="d517-f1-content">
                <p>Member of the Kuomintang Central Executive Committee.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d517-f2" n="3" xml:id="d517-f2-content">
                <p>Chinese Air Force.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
